{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2022-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1644883200, "end_date": 1645487999, "month_true_total": 36, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:51:31 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "110605241", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986877093", "personaname": "Echo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mlx4/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 3442, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1665, "last_played": 1720303761, "avatar": "0d99bc0a984d8763a444af8b65eedac6e0d05912"}, "language": "english", "review": "9/10 bring back edf4's marching chant\n\nMore seriously, this game is a beautiful mess. Sure the difficulty is all over the place and some corners aren't properly sanded and polished, but the game still manages to be some of the most fun i've had playing a videogame in years. Remeber that? When games were designed to [i]be fun?[/i] That is most certainly EDF's strongsuit. The game feels so much better than 4.1, with all sorts of little quality of life changes and new systems and tweaks that make it feel just that much better to play. It's not the prettiest game on the planet, it's certainly not the most balanced, but I still suggest it without hesitation.\n\nNow get out there and save the Earth, soldier.", "timestamp_created": 1645328907, "timestamp_updated": 1645328907, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "110582260", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999393791", "personaname": "Lykha Lovell", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lykha_biabia/", "num_games_owned": 1622, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 17647, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8145, "last_played": 1711524480, "avatar": "6a36f45ee65c58357f5f346ffa378398762a040a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Top tier arcade game.  It's a kind of janky third person shooter where you defend the earth by killing monsters with city-destroying weapons.  This is a gamey game, though— there's no punishment for killing the city, do what you need to to save the earth.  The game scales, so while you may be using pea shooters are first eventually you'll get sniper rifles that pierce armor, orbs that float in the air and shoot enemy-tracking beams, a machine gun that shoots punches, and most cool of all calling down air strikes that can destroy entire blocks.\n\nI'm 135 hours in and haven't finished it yet.  It's good online and offline.  Randos are useful online.  The community is nice.  Not many people play but those who do really get it.", "timestamp_created": 1645299663, "timestamp_updated": 1645299663, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "110547372", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042453497", "personaname": "Shit Puppet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jennid3/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 6535, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2705, "last_played": 1762046288, "avatar": "d48e57dc4672700340cfa24a7bd40409dee829f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great distraction from life", "timestamp_created": 1645262552, "timestamp_updated": 1645262552, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.586776852607727051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "110437600", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054129583", "personaname": "Glacier", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198054129583/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 12675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10829, "last_played": 1685775981, "avatar": "034609a8a4810014ef54d3d0e493b86be5a6d756"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just as good as its previous games, and better!", "timestamp_created": 1645118887, "timestamp_updated": 1645118887, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "110394362", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121658997", "personaname": "Caecus Iustiam", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198121658997/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4110, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2124, "last_played": 1743964078, "avatar": "d93a41722e6d17b98ada96d68149a11c386f4134"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDF! Way more user friendly item pick up and leveling of weapons instead of copies and grinding empty rewards.", "timestamp_created": 1645062574, "timestamp_updated": 1645062574, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500745177268981934", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam